    "Exceeds the empirical ceiling (0.124): the representation adds over the best cheap supervised readout of composition features. On this task that is the expected outcome rather than evidence of saturation, because composition cannot nearly solve cross-family enzyme-class transfer, so the ceiling is a comparator and not an attainable maximum. `derived.headroom` is therefore negative and must not be read as headroom on PR4.",
